{"page": 15, "width": 960, "height": 540, "text": "Issued faces in eGramSwaraj and Audit Online\nSection :- Audit Online\nDelay in mapping of PRI functionaries in the Audit Online platform consequently, it was not possible\nfor the respective Audit Parties to send entry meeting to the concerned units on time due to non-\nacceptance\n delay in acceptance of entry meeting, Audit Parties were unable to record audit observation and\ngenerate Audit Report.\nChecking of draft Audit Reports at the HQ are normally carried out at three levels (e.g. first at the\nlevel of Auditor/ Sr. Auditor, second at the level of Assistant Audit Officer and finally at the level of Sr.\nAudit Officer). Due to limitation of the Audit Online software, here checking is constrained to be\ncarried out at the final level only. In absence of first two level of checking, it takes time at the level of\nSr. Audit Officers to exercise all types of checks.\nThe Audit Report on the Accounts of PRI contains the comments on the summary of Accounts, the\nObservations and Audit Opinion. The Audit Online application is not designed to prepare a\nconsolidated report incorporating all three parts in one go. Rather, the Report is to be generated by\npreparing several pdf files and uploading those in the system which is not only cumbersome and time\nconsuming, causing considerable delay.\nDepartment of Panchayats & Rural Developement, W.B.", "words": [{"text": "Issued", "x0": 242.16, "x1": 321.91967999999997, "top": 37.493352000000016, "doctop": 7597.493352, "bottom": 61.51735200000002, "upright": true, "height": 24.024, "width": 79.75967999999997, "direction": "ltr"}, {"text": "faces", "x0": 330.08784, "x1": 393.439128, "top": 37.493352000000016, "doctop": 7597.493352, "bottom": 61.51735200000002, "upright": true, "height": 24.024, "width": 63.351287999999954, "direction": "ltr"}, {"text": "in", "x0": 401.607288, "x1": 426.592248, "top": 37.493352000000016, "doctop": 7597.493352, "bottom": 61.51735200000002